    "content": "<p><strong>Slide 1 – Title &amp; Welcome</strong></p><p><strong>From Prompt to Productivity: Build Your First Private AI Assistant in Just 2 Hours</strong></p><p><strong>Duration:</strong> 2 hours (90 min hands-on + 30 min Q&amp;A)</p><p>You will leave with Ollama running locally <strong>and</strong> your first working private AI assistant (chat via web UI or simple messaging) that helps with daily business and personal tasks — 100% free and offline.</p><p><strong>Slide 2 – Why Professionals Need AI Assistants Now</strong></p><p>Manual tasks waste time and money. Local AI handles research, writing, summaries, report outlines, and simple automation instantly with full privacy and zero ongoing cost.</p><p>Real impact: 70% faster daily work, impressive client-ready outputs.</p><p>Key stat: “Professionals using AI assistants complete 40% more work efficiently.”</p><p><strong>Slide 3 – Free AI Tools Crash Course: Local Setup vs Paid Options (15 min)</strong></p><p><strong>Learning Outcomes:</strong> Navigate Hugging Face and run your first model confidently.</p><p><strong>What You’ll Do:</strong> Quick tour of Hugging Face (free model library) + Ollama/LM Studio/Jan.ai (free local runners).</p><p>Brief comparison: Paid tools like ChatGPT Plus or Claude Pro give faster responses, larger context, and higher daily limits — but local free tools offer complete privacy, offline use, and zero cost forever.</p><p><strong>Activity:</strong> Install Ollama (one command), pull a free model (e.g., Qwen3.5, GLM-4.7, DeepSeek V3.2), and chat in terminal or Jan.ai/Open WebUI.</p><p><strong>Why It Impresses Clients:</strong> Deliver private, instant AI-powered business documents or plans without subscriptions.</p><p><strong>Image Prompt for Slide:</strong> “Modern professional Lagos office, dramatic spotlighting, glowing laptop showing Ollama terminal and Hugging Face model library with clean productivity chat interface, teal and gold accents, high-end editorial style.”</p><p><strong>Slide 4 – Running Your First Local AI Model – Hands-On (35 min)</strong></p><p><strong>Learning Outcomes:</strong> Install, run, and use free local LLMs for productivity.</p><p><strong>Step-by-step (live + follow along):</strong></p><ol><li>Install Ollama or LM Studio (free).</li><li>Pull and test strong free models from Hugging Face.</li><li>Quick side-by-side prompt test (free local vs. what paid tools would deliver faster/better on complex tasks).</li></ol><p><strong>Activity:</strong> Generate business emails, market research summaries, or weekly work plans using free models.</p><p><strong>Slide 5 – Turn It Into Your First Productivity Assistant (25 min)</strong></p><p><strong>Learning Outcomes:</strong> Set up a simple personal assistant.</p><p><strong>Activity:</strong> Use Open WebUI or Jan.ai with your local model (or basic AnythingLLM setup). Test chat-based tasks (summarize notes, draft replies, outline reports).</p><p>Comparison note: Paid platforms like Claude Projects or ChatGPT Custom GPTs add polished interfaces and extra features, but free local setups give you full control and privacy today.</p><p><strong>Slide 6 – Real Applications &amp; Next Steps (15 min)</strong></p><p>Use cases: Daily productivity, content drafting, quick research, client proposal outlines.</p><p><strong>Teaser for Full Course &amp; Intermediate:</strong> In the 4-week program you’ll deepen prompt skills and add agentic capabilities; later levels cover advanced free workflows and when paid tools become worth considering for scale.</p><p><strong>CTA:</strong> Download your free “Local AI Productivity Starter Kit” (Ollama/LM Studio commands, best free Hugging Face models list, prompt templates, setup guides) + join the full program. Special 20% off for teaser attendees.</p><p><strong>Slide 7 – Hands-On Challenge &amp; Peer Showcase (10 min)</strong></p><p>Improve a prompt for a real task (e.g., “Create a business report outline for a small Lagos enterprise”) and share screens.</p><p><strong>Slide 8 – Q&amp;A, Certificates &amp; Group Photo</strong></p><p>Certificate: “Completed My First Private AI Productivity Assistant”</p>",
