    "title": "From Prompt to 3D: Learn AI + 3D Creation in Just 2 Hours",
    "description": "Discover how to combine free Artificial Intelligence tools with Blender to turn simple text prompts into stunning, editable 3D models in minutes. Perfect for beginners who want to create product visuals, characters, environments, or concept art without traditional modeling skills. You will leave with your own AI-generated 3D asset ready to render and present.",
