    "title": "AI-Assisted UI/UX Teaser Course",
    "description": "Turn raw ideas into professional, interactive prototypes in just 2 hours using free AI tools + Figma. This live teaser teaches designers, product managers, and freelancers how to generate smart layouts and user flows instantly with AI, then polish them into pixel-perfect, shareable designs in Figma. You’ll leave with a complete productivity app prototype ready for client presentations — cutting design time dramatically while delivering that “wow” factor.",
