    "content": "<p><strong>Full Course Title:</strong></p><p>Enterprise Agentic AI: Scale Free Local Systems for Business Productivity</p><p><strong>Full 4-Week Course (~12-15 hours total)</strong></p><p><strong>Week 1: Production Deployment &amp; Infrastructure (2 hours)</strong></p><ul><li>Setting up persistent and scalable local AI environments (Docker basics with Ollama, LocalAI)</li><li>Running larger free models efficiently (Qwen3.5-32B+, GLM-5 variants, DeepSeek)</li><li>Hardware and optimization strategies for business use</li><li>Hands-on: Deploy a stable local AI server on your laptop</li></ul><p><strong>Week 2: Multi-Agent Systems with Free Tools (3 hours)</strong></p><ul><li>Building multi-agent teams using free open-source frameworks (LangGraph, CrewAI community, or similar self-hosted options)</li><li>Agent collaboration, task delegation, and orchestration</li><li>Advanced prompt engineering for complex agent workflows</li><li>Activity: Create a two-agent system (e.g., Researcher Agent + Writer Agent)</li></ul><p><strong>Week 3: RAG, Integrations &amp; Business Workflows (3 hours)</strong></p><ul><li>Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) over your own documents and knowledge bases using AnythingLLM or free vector stores</li><li>Simple business integrations (Google Workspace via free local bridges, email handling, file systems)</li><li>Creating end-to-end workflows (client proposal generation, automated reporting)</li><li>Hands-on: Build RAG-powered agents that pull from your personal or business files</li></ul><p><strong>Week 4: Scaling, Security &amp; Client Delivery (3-4 hours)</strong></p><ul><li>Security, monitoring, and best practices for production use</li><li>Voice and image extensions using free local methods (if hardware allows)</li><li>Packaging and delivering AI solutions to clients</li><li>Capstone project: Design and deploy a complete enterprise-grade agentic workflow for a small business scenario</li><li>Bonus: Free enterprise toolkit (deployment scripts, RAG templates, multi-agent examples, paid-tool comparison guide)</li></ul><p><strong>Outcome:</strong> Students leave able to design, deploy, and maintain scalable agentic AI systems for personal businesses or enterprise clients — all running locally with free tools, plus informed guidance on paid upgrades.</p>\\",
