    "description": "Description\\n\\nJump into game development with Unity — no experience needed! In this fast-paced 2-hour session, you’ll build and play your own 3D endless runner game from scratch. Learn the Unity editor, add a running character, obstacles, jumping, and scoring. Walk away with a fun, shareable mini-game and the confidence to continue creating.",
