    "title": "Build Your First Unreal Engine Game Scene with AI in Just",
    "description": "Jump into modern game development in a single fun 2-hour live session. Using Unreal Engine 5 (free) and free AI tools, you’ll create a complete mini scene — a stylized sci-fi corridor with interactive elements, AI-generated textures, and a simple playable character. Perfect for aspiring indie devs, hobbyists, and creatives who want to see their ideas come to life instantly. By the end, you’ll have a shareable mini-demo ready for portfolios or social media.",
    "is_active": true,
    "start_date": null,
